dbce_shim.dll: private provisional DBCE input shim dependency.
Source: d-b-c-e/outrun2-decomp, branch codex/shim-device-path, commit f49cfc559f065b778967a7c94068a75df538ec69.
SHA256: 9b8a036f664cf8f45cccf82b98e5e4376f93215b60eac50b6db965bf498015d8
See vendor/dbce-shim/PROVENANCE.md in the source candidate for the build.
The target compiles windows/shim and windows/host with the vendored controls
and session headers, independently of the game's reconstructed runtime.
No redistribution grant for this provisional target is asserted here. The
root mod MIT license does not license it. Extracting the shared shim into
its reusable toolkit and settling its source/license notice is still required
before public distribution. This package is for authorized private review.
